  "title": "Chain of Being",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Chain of Being is a mythic science fiction podcast which is a glimpse into the future: where gods control the cosmos and mortals are left to fend for themselves in a vast, indifferent universe. Follow the immortal Adam (of eden fame) as he hunts down an extra-universal threat whilst also confronting his past. Set in an extensive universe that blends religious fantasy elements with space opera science fiction. All lovingly written and sound designed by a student from south london since they were 17 years old, and featuring a range of voice acting talent. https://www.patreon.com/faustiannonsense",
